ing function $P_2(x)$ was recently given by Pudwell and Smith (the case k=1 being trivial). We show that $P_k(x)$ is rational for any k. Moreover, we give an algorithm to derive $P_k(x)$, and using it we determine the generating functions $P_k(x)$ for $k\\leq 6$.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPostural Control Deficits in Patients With Chronic Inflammatory Demyelinating Polyradiculoneuropathy Undergoing Immunomodulatory Therapy - Pudwell - 2026 - Muscle & Nerve - Wiley Online Library (https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1002/mus.70240)\nciteturn8search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 6 months ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; Heather Pudwell, ... Smith,\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nFertility monotonicity and average complexity of the stack-sorting map - ScienceDirect (https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/am/pii/S0195669820301967)\nciteturn8search6 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 months ago; In [18], Dukes investigated the map revstack≔s\\circ rev and stated Steingrímsson’s Sorting Conjecture, which says that \\left|{revstack}^{-t}(123\\cdots n)\\right|\\ge \\left|{s}^{-t}(123\\cdots n)\\right| for all 0\\le t<n. ... Pop-stack-sorting\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nFerrari Luca | Scheda personale | CercaChi - UniFI | UniFI (https://cercachi.unifi.it/p-doc2-0-0-A-3f2b342a382931.html)\nciteturn8search7 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Image: Articolo su Rivista   Cioni, Lapo; Ferrari, Luca; Smith, Rebecca (2026). ... Pop Stacks with a Bypass.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProceedings of the 2015 Annual ACM-SIAM Symposium on Discrete Algorithms (SODA) | SIAM Publications Library (https://epubs.siam.org/doi/book/10.1137/1.9781611973730)\nciteturn8search8 [wordlim: 200] Published: 11.9 years ago; Crawled: today; As our main result, we prove that fo